                        ],
                        "form": "sie sind pangeschlechtlich"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bdf9c6a7-2016-3cf8-a0ac-1532274c0a5e",
                        "entry_id": "c414a200-d2ca-3bba-be78-256c9ea72cd4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "eine alle Geschlechter erfassende Geschlechtsidentität aufweisend"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "418c26d1-5ab1-4b66-90e9-b107001b0f93",
                                "sense_id": "bdf9c6a7-2016-3cf8-a0ac-1532274c0a5e",
                                "text": "„Im Gegensatz dazu gibt es pangeschlechtliche Menschen. Diese Gruppe definiert sich, indem die Menschen sich jedem Geschlecht zugehörig fühlen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cba0a2a0-4288-4568-a79f-7b4b16d2f17c",
                                "sense_id": "bdf9c6a7-2016-3cf8-a0ac-1532274c0a5e",
                                "text": "„2014 schob die venezolanische Produzentin auf ihrem Debütalbum noch die pangeschlechtliche ‚Xen‘ als Folie vor.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b421ec58-beab-4f7f-8083-bda52d0627f9",
                                "sense_id": "bdf9c6a7-2016-3cf8-a0ac-1532274c0a5e",
                                "text": "„Und es ist quasi die pangeschlechtliche Projektion von Arca, hat er mal gesagt.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb29623c-60fc-4774-b7a5-2e75e9c79c65",
                                "sense_id": "bdf9c6a7-2016-3cf8-a0ac-1532274c0a5e",
                                "text": "„Zu den neuen Optionen gehören nun z.B. geschlechtslos, zissexuell (das Gegenteil von transsexuell), intersexuell, nicht-binär, pangeschlechtlich und anderes, für das es teilweise im Deutschen noch keine Begriffe gibt.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e3bac2b-deae-47eb-898d-4ca2573c6245",
                                "sense_id": "bdf9c6a7-2016-3cf8-a0ac-1532274c0a5e",
                                "text": "„Was weiblich und was männlich ist, meint man zu wissen, doch was sind androgyne, gender variable, intersexuelle, geschlechtslose, genderqueere, pangeschlechtliche, inter* [sic] oder trans* [sic] Menschen, was sind Zwitter, Hermaphroditen, Transvestiten, Cross-Gender?“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a9713b14-6303-48c7-a92a-10f7bab9ed93",
                        "source_entry_id": "c414a200-d2ca-3bba-be78-256c9ea72cd4",
                        "source_sense_id": "bdf9c6a7-2016-3cf8-a0ac-1532274c0a5e",
                        "source_sense_description": "eine alle Geschlechter erfassende Geschlechtsidentität aufweisend",
                        "target_lang_word": "pangender",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pangender",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "59a7df5f-7f6b-3b89-b780-0c6f0fefc1ab",
                                        "entry_id": "3c8ef7f0-2a06-3269-80f9-837e63104be4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Encompassing or including all genders."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a512c15-f5f7-4609-b117-6c9e59465972",
                                                "sense_id": "59a7df5f-7f6b-3b89-b780-0c6f0fefc1ab",
                                                "text": "These critiques distort Gilligan's thesis, it seems to me; she can be read as arguing that the morality of women is currently undervalued culturally and as calling for its reintegration into pangender morality, not for its use as a universal standard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd2b009f-729c-48da-b698-c292c5cd028e",
                                                "sense_id": "59a7df5f-7f6b-3b89-b780-0c6f0fefc1ab",
                                                "text": "On one level, these changes many have served as a defensive maneuver to tone down some of the actor's pangender sexual magnetism and the homoeroticized responses associated with him as a male theatrical idol."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "758e51cb-85b1-4514-be5f-219db02917f3",
                                                "sense_id": "59a7df5f-7f6b-3b89-b780-0c6f0fefc1ab",
                                                "text": "Then came the tidal wave of drugs, specifically heroin, and what had once been a haven for male alcoholics became a pangender hole-in-the-wall hideout for depraved junkies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a87954ac-c86d-3f4e-8788-6bcc2d00c975",
                                        "entry_id": "3c8ef7f0-2a06-3269-80f9-837e63104be4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Identifying with all genders."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d3d6735-f0c3-44a9-85e4-874a4f2d5c3b",
                                                "sense_id": "a87954ac-c86d-3f4e-8788-6bcc2d00c975",
                                                "text": "Born as a physical male, she now identifies as transfeminine, or pangender."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffee4cda-2796-41aa-b42f-209f0e8cb5ca",
                                                "sense_id": "a87954ac-c86d-3f4e-8788-6bcc2d00c975",
                                                "text": "Just don't be surprised if you meet someone who identifies as a \"non-binary neutrois pangender genderpunk autistic aspiequeer queer lithsexual punk anti-kyriarchist anarchist.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d21eca9e-c022-4792-a4bf-fc2a2ae63378",
                                                "sense_id": "a87954ac-c86d-3f4e-8788-6bcc2d00c975",
                                                "text": "Ranging from pangender to genderqueer and even intersex, the choices Facebook has included accurately reflects the diversity and differences of this day and age."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
